    "/v1/classifications/catalog": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Returns active classification buckets with optional tag lists. Each bucket carries its canonical `type`, accepted `alias[]` spellings, `tagCount`, and (when includeTags=true) the active `tag[]`. Use bucketType to scope to one bucket and includeTags=false to fetch metadata only. For tag ids, prefer `classifications tags --type <bucket> --q <name>` over broad catalog JSON; use returned tag.id as EntityClassificationMutation.tagId when writing classifications. Dormant registry tags are intentionally omitted; type + name writes that find one return 409 with inactiveTagOverride recovery choices.",
