    "/v1/deploy/pairs/{pairName}/promotions": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Promotes a configured deploy pair from the selected staging source. RunningOnStaging resolves the image currently running on each staging target; NewestStagingBuild uses the newest immutable staging tag in the registry for each image. After each immutable main-{version}-{sha} tag is ensured, the back-end deploys and proves each production target in configured order. A later member failure compensates every attempted member with its captured prior image and healthcheck path. Promoting from the production console redeploys the orchestrating back-end itself, so compensation is guaranteed only when driven from the staging console.",
