    "/v1/entities/classifications/reconcile": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Reconciles each entity's standardized classification joins to the caller's desired exact set. The server computes the delete/patch/create diff, guards every entity with the audited expectedHash, and applies each diff in its own atomic transaction with post-apply exact-set verification. apply=false (default) returns the computed plan without writing. Stale rows are reported separately from failures and are never modified.",
