        "description": "Creates a research snippet for an entity. Snippets are an append-only time series: creating a row defaults isCurrent/isPrimary to true and demotes the prior current/primary row of the same textType to inactive history, so refresh by creating a new row rather than overwriting. Pass a textType listed by GET /v1/entities/research/snippets/types: those are validated against the type's length and paragraph rules and are visible by default. An unrecognized textType is still saved but defaults to visible=false (hidden from default reads). The response returns a NOT_VISIBLE warning header whenever the saved row is hidden (visible=false), and no warning when it is visible; send visible=true to publish an unrecognized type anyway.",
        "operationId": "createResearchSnippet",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "description": "Canonical entity UUID.",
            "example": "04e2bf9c-a100-72ad-83ff-ba69c647b30b",
