      "get": {
        "description": "Returns database telemetry from Supabase Metrics API for the primary instance: \\\nconnection states, database size, transaction counts, deadlocks, \\\ncache hit ratio, tuple operations, replication lag (if applicable), \\\ncheckpoint statistics, pool health, query performance, system load, \\\nand Supabase service SQL metrics. Short-lived server-side caching respects API rate limits.",
