    "/v1/web/profile/scrape": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Submits a public profile URL (LinkedIn person/company, bare X account, Crunchbase organization, or PitchBook company) to the Bright Data Web Scraper and returns a snapshot ticket immediately. Poll the returned statusUrl until the result reaches READY. LinkedIn usually completes in seconds; Crunchbase and PitchBook routinely take minutes, so poll over a multi-minute budget and never block on it. The returned profile is a live projection; exact ready-snapshot bytes are retained before decoding.",
