        "type": "object",
        "description": "Typed extension on ProblemDetail.details for HTTP 409 when a create/update attempts to set a URL with urlType=website (or another exclusive urlType) that is already a current URL on a different entity or person. The existingJoin list names every current owner of the normalized URL; resolve by demoting the existing owner (isCurrent=false, isPrimary=false) before promoting the new owner.",
        "properties": {
